    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44600" root="&#xA;                        وشى&#xA;                    " body-key="w1">
                        
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شِيَةٌ</span></b> 
                        
                        <i>Any colour differing from the main
colour</i> of a horse, &amp;c.; <i>a colour differing from
the rest,</i> (S,) or <i>from that which generally
pervades a thing.</i> ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَا شِيَةَ فِيهِ</span>
                        <i>It is of one
generally pervading colour, in which is no other
colour.</i> ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شِيَةٌ</span> [also] <i>A mark, sign, symptom,</i>
or <i>token, by which a thing is known;</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَلَامَةٌ</span>;
(Msb;) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَخِيلَةٌ</span>, which see.

